This repository is a mixed-license content collection.

EFS-created metadata, manifests, catalog files, dataset READMEs, curation notes,
and original summaries are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
Universal unless a file says otherwise.

EFS-created software and scripts are licensed under the MIT License unless a
file says otherwise. New scripts should include:

  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Third-party works are not relicensed by EFS. Each third-party file remains
under its original license or distribution terms. The relevant manifest,
dataset README, in-file notices, and NOTICE.md should record the known author,
source, license, redistribution status, and modification status.

Files marked link-only, review-required, unclear, unknown, NOASSERTION, or
not-allowed must not be pinned, mirrored, or redistributed as EFS-hosted bytes
until their rights status is resolved.

